{"video":"mveGQHMMpR8","lines":[{"t":[0,4],"en":"-You know, I met Gail right here at Shermpton."},{"t":[4,4.8],"en":"-Mm-hmm."},{"t":[4.8,8.7],"en":"-She was slender, blond hair, big breasts, long legs."},{"t":[8.7,10.8],"en":"Ugh. Not my type at all."},{"t":[10.8,14.5],"en":"-And what was it exactly that led to you two hitting it off?"},{"t":[14.5,16],"en":"Was she ill?"},{"t":[16,19.2],"en":"Or did your father witness her father committing a crime?"},{"t":[19.2,20.3],"en":"Or was she temporarily blonde?"},{"t":[20.3,22.4],"en":"-You know what? All that matters is you got married"},{"t":[22.4,23.3],"en":"and you're happy."},{"t":[23.3,25.3],"en":"So as all-time best man,"},{"t":[25.3,27.8],"en":"I suggest we raise a cone to Jerry Gergich."},{"t":[27.8,29.3],"en":"-Jerry Gergich! -Jerry Gergich!"},{"t":[29.3,31.3],"en":"-Thank you! -Jerry Gergich!"},{"t":[31.3,33.8],"en":"-Oh, jeez. -No worries, Gary."},{"t":[33.8,36.4],"en":"-Thank you. -Mm-hmm."},{"t":[36.4,38.4],"en":"-How did you have that ready so fast?"},{"t":[38.4,39.8],"en":"-I always make a backup cone."},{"t":[39.8,42.9],"en":"He drops hit about half the time."},{"t":[42.9,44.2],"en":"-Annie, you're next."},{"t":[44.2,46.3],"en":"Any activity in the world, what would you do?"},{"t":[46.3,48],"en":"-Well, mine's impossible."},{"t":[48,49.3],"en":"I want us to see a Colts game."},{"t":[49.3,51.4],"en":"I want to see the Colts beat the Patriots 49-0,"},{"t":[51.4,53.1],"en":"then I yell at Tom Brady and make him cry,"},{"t":[53.1,54.3],"en":"then I hook up with Dave Matthews"},{"t":[54.3,56.3],"en":"and we play Golden Tee for ten hours."},{"t":[56.3,57.5],"en":"Hi, little baby!"},{"t":[57.5,60.4],"en":"That's a very specific dream, son."},{"t":[60.4,63.6],"en":"-Hey, Jim, Chris Traynor, I need a favor."},{"t":[65.6,67.3],"en":"-I'm dead. I am dead."},{"t":[67.3,69.9],"en":"And this is what heaven is like."},{"t":[69.9,71.4],"en":"I knew it."},{"t":[71.4,74.5],"en":"-Oh, this is where they play the games."},{"t":[74.5,76],"en":"-You're up, Andy."},{"t":[76,77],"en":"-Hey, guys!"},{"t":[77,78.6],"en":"Guys, come on over here."},{"t":[78.6,81.1],"en":"Andy, I want you to meet Indianapolis Colts owner,"},{"t":[81.1,82],"en":"Jim Irsay."},{"t":[82,84.1],"en":"Andy, good to meet you, my friend."},{"t":[84.1,85.8],"en":"-Thank you. I love your team, sir."},{"t":[85.8,87.4],"en":"I love them like they're my own children."},{"t":[87.4,89.3],"en":"-You're big enough to play football yourself,"},{"t":[89.3,90.1],"en":"it looks like to me."},{"t":[90.1,92.5],"en":"-I can't tell if you're joking, but I hope you're not."},{"t":[92.5,95],"en":"-This whole place is yours."},{"t":[95,96.7],"en":"Jim Irsay and I became friends"},{"t":[96.7,99.5],"en":"while volunteering to mentor Indianapolis teens."},{"t":[99.5,101.4],"en":"I gave them tours of the Statehouse."},{"t":[101.4,105.1],"en":"Jim gave them Colts tickets and autographed jerseys."},{"t":[105.1,106.6],"en":"-They preferred Jim."},{"t":[106.6,107.8],"en":"-Reggie Wayne!"},{"t":[107.8,109.7],"en":"-I can't look at you, Reggie Wayne."},{"t":[109.7,110.7],"en":"-Oh."},{"t":[110.7,112.1],"en":"-I got married in your jersey."},{"t":[112.1,112.9],"en":"-That's no joke."},{"t":[112.9,114.3],"en":"-That's weird."},{"t":[114.3,115.5],"en":"But I respect that."},{"t":[115.5,117.2],"en":"-I'm a big fan, Mr. Luck."},{"t":[117.2,118.8],"en":"-Okay, guy. Settle down."},{"t":[118.8,119.8],"en":"-Okay."},{"t":[119.8,122.2],"en":"-Mr. Andrew Luck, it's every groom's dream"},{"t":[122.2,124.1],"en":"to catch a touchdown pass thrown by you."},{"t":[124.1,125.2],"en":"Could you do me the honor?"},{"t":[125.2,126.2],"en":"-Yeah, let's do it."},{"t":[126.2,127.1],"en":"-Keep the spiral tight?"},{"t":[127.1,127.7],"en":"-I'll try."},{"t":[127.7,128.7],"en":"-Okay."},{"t":[132.7,134.7],"en":"-Oh!"},{"t":[134.7,135.7],"en":"-Let's go!"},{"t":[135.7,137.3],"en":"-Dway!"},{"t":[140.3,141.3],"en":"-See ya."},{"t":[141.3,147.2],"en":"-Hey, yeah, I wanna shoot, baby, shoot."},{"t":[147.2,149.8],"en":"-Here I go, here I go, here I go again."},{"t":[149.8,151.6],"en":"-What's my weakness, man?"},{"t":[151.6,152.6],"en":"-Okay, then."},{"t":[152.6,155],"en":"-Let's call Anne real quick and rub it in."},{"t":[155,156.5],"en":"-Hello?"},{"t":[156.5,157.2],"en":"-Anne Perkins."},{"t":[157.2,158.2],"en":"-Anne Perkins!"},{"t":[158.2,160.2],"en":"-Anne Perkins!"},{"t":[160.2,163.3],"en":"-Good time of our lives, and I'm calling you to rub it in."},{"t":[163.3,164.3],"en":"-Really?"},{"t":[164.3,165.9],"en":"-We went to an insane bar."},{"t":[165.9,167.3],"en":"-Played football with the Colts!"},{"t":[167.3,168.1],"en":"-With the Colts!"},{"t":[168.1,169.7],"en":"-With the Colts!"},{"t":[169.7,171.8],"en":"-Now we're going to a steakhouse."},{"t":[171.8,172.8],"en":"What are you doing?"},{"t":[172.8,175.6],"en":"-Uh, well, we're surrounded by hot guys."},{"t":[175.6,177.5],"en":"-We're surrounded by hot guys."},{"t":[177.5,178.7],"en":"-Boom!"},{"t":[178.7,181.5],"en":"-Oh, Donna just ripped off a stripper's underwear"},{"t":[181.5,182.5],"en":"with her teeth."},{"t":[182.5,183.5],"en":"-Woo!"},{"t":[183.5,184.5],"en":"-Anne, who are you lying to?"},{"t":[184.5,185.5],"en":"-Oh, no!"},{"t":[185.5,186.5],"en":"-What?"},{"t":[186.5,187.5],"en":"-Can I take a break?"},{"t":[187.5,188.5],"en":"My hands are tired."},{"t":[188.5,189.5],"en":"-Uh-uh."},{"t":[189.5,190.9],"en":"We paid for an hour, you're gonna dig for an hour."},{"t":[190.9,194],"en":"-Gentlemen, welcome to the steakhouse of St. Elmo!"},{"t":[194,195],"en":"-Yes!"},{"t":[195,196.6],"en":"-When we eat something's flesh!"},{"t":[196.6,198.2],"en":"I WANT MEAT!"},{"t":[198.2,200.2],"en":"-Jerry, are you sure this is our table?"},{"t":[200.2,201.2],"en":"There's only four settings."},{"t":[201.2,202],"en":"-Excuse me, sir."},{"t":[202,203.2],"en":"This is not your table."},{"t":[203.2,204.6],"en":"-Well, I thought you said the Gergich party."},{"t":[204.6,205.2],"en":"-No, no."},{"t":[205.2,206.6],"en":"I said the Gingrich party."},{"t":[206.6,209.3],"en":"-Oh, my gosh, I'm so sorry."},{"t":[209.3,210.3],"en":"-Damn it, Jerry."},{"t":[210.3,211.3],"en":"-But you know what?"},{"t":[211.3,212.3],"en":"Gingrich, Gergich."},{"t":[212.3,214.3],"en":"I wonder if we're related."},{"t":[214.3,216.3],"en":"-I don't think so, Jerry."},{"t":[216.3,217.3],"en":"-Okay."},{"t":[217.3,222.3],"en":"One rare porterhouse, one rare sirloin, and a rasher of bacon."},{"t":[222.3,224.3],"en":"-That's the Lord's work you're doing, John."},{"t":[224.3,228.3],"en":"I'd like four more glasses of Lagavulin in liquid form."},{"t":[228.3,230.3],"en":"-That's not something you really need to specify."},{"t":[230.3,232.3],"en":"-You'd be surprised."},{"t":[232.3,235.3],"en":"-So, bachelor boy, how's it going with Diane?"},{"t":[235.3,236.3],"en":"-Hmm."},{"t":[236.3,238.3],"en":"I'm gonna be very candid with you all."},{"t":[238.3,240.3],"en":"I like her."},{"t":[240.3,243.3],"en":"-Oh!"},{"t":[243.3,245.3],"en":"-Okay, okay, okay."},{"t":[245.3,248.3],"en":"There are so many things that I could say about Ron,"},{"t":[248.3,250.3],"en":"but I think that the best man's speech"},{"t":[250.3,252.3],"en":"should represent the groom."},{"t":[252.3,255.3],"en":"So I will just say, to Ron."},{"t":[255.3,257.3],"en":"-Oh, to Ron!"},{"t":[257.3,258.3],"en":"-To Ron!"},{"t":[258.3,259.3],"en":"-Just perfect."},{"t":[259.3,260.3],"en":"Perfect, Chris."},{"t":[260.3,261.3],"en":"-Here you are, sir."},{"t":[261.3,262.3],"en":"And I thought you might also like to know"},{"t":[262.3,264.3],"en":"that your meal has already been taken care of"},{"t":[264.3,265.3],"en":"by Mr. Hibbert."},{"t":[265.3,266.3],"en":"-What?"},{"t":[266.3,267.3],"en":"-Oh, what?"},{"t":[270.3,271.3],"en":"-Hibbert!"},{"t":[271.3,272.3],"en":"-What's up, devil shot?"},{"t":[272.3,273.3],"en":"-Hey, man."},{"t":[273.3,275.3],"en":"Roy Hibbert, Entertainment 720 reunion."},{"t":[275.3,276.3],"en":"-Hey, Tom."},{"t":[276.3,277.3],"en":"I am not paying for that guy."},{"t":[277.3,279.3],"en":"He owes me a lot of money."},{"t":[279.3,280.3],"en":"It's true."},{"t":[280.3,281.3],"en":"It's true."}]}
